      <section class="ent-cta ent-partner" id="design-partners" aria-labelledby="cta-h" data-float-spot>
        <p class="ent-badge"><span class="ent-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Design partner pilots open</p>
        <h2 id="cta-h">Build the future of your business with us.</h2>
        <p class="ent-lede">For startups of 2 to 300 people that are funded or earning revenue. Start with a 90-day pilot with no OpenShore fee. At day 90, become a customer with today’s price locked for two years, or walk away. In return, you help us shape it.</p>
        <div class="ent-deal">
          <div>
            <h3>You get</h3>
            <ul role="list">
              <li>A 90-day pilot with no OpenShore fee. You pay your own cloud and model bills, at cost</li>
              <li>Today’s price of $500 a bot per month, locked for two years, even if our list price goes up</li>
              <li>Your $5,000 setup, paid when we install, credited against your first year if you stay. If you leave at day 90, it covers the setup work</li>
              <li>A real say in the roadmap: need a bot we don’t have yet? We build it with you</li>
              <li>First access to every new bot</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>We ask</h3>
            <ul role="list">
              <li>A short signed agreement, with your success measures and the day-90 decision, before anything is installed</li>
              <li>A sponsor who owns the budget, a named owner and a technical contact: whoever holds your cloud and admin accounts, not necessarily an engineer</li>
              <li>A dedicated cloud account for OpenShore, on your keys. We set it up with you</li>
              <li>Three months of past commission statements or month-end closes, so we can test against numbers you trust</li>
              <li>A structured review every two weeks, plus quick feedback whenever something comes up</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Guardrails</h3>
            <ul role="list">
              <li>Read-only until you approve each workflow</li>
              <li>A person on your team signs off on every change</li>
              <li>By default we see service telemetry, like errors, uptime and versions, with no customer content. Anything deeper is with your permission, limited to that task, and logged</li>
              <li>Turn our access off, or leave, any time. Your data stays in your cloud</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="ent-cfo"><b>A cost your CFO can approve.</b> The pilot carries no OpenShore fee beyond the one-time $5,000 setup, and your cloud and model bills come from your providers at cost. We walk your CFO through the numbers before you start, and you can leave any time.</p>
        <p class="ent-founder-line">Built by <a href="/grow-with-us/">Jack Bigelow</a>, who spent more than 15 years in operations, the last 10 building the revenue operations, planning and AI systems behind businesses as large as $200B at Amazon, AWS and Microsoft.</p>
        <p class="ent-lede ent-partner-ask">To apply, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.enterpriseContact }}?subject={{ 'OpenShore design partner' | urlencode }}">{{ site.enterpriseContact }}</a>. Jack reads every message and replies personally.</p>
